# Keep LF in the working tree for text files, so a Windows checkout matches CI.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary

# Kiota-generated Management API client. Committed so CI/contributors do not
# need a live Umbraco instance to build (see GitHub issue #50). Marked generated
# so GitHub collapses it in diffs and excludes it from language stats. Regenerate
# with scripts/regen-client.ps1 rather than editing by hand.
src/Umbraco.Community.Cli.Client/Generated/** linguist-generated=true
